-- check/bad: checker-v2.md §8.4, amended 2026-10-26 (#1048). An annotation
-- cannot make a block value made by a call general again: `r : Ref (List a)`
-- promises a cell of every list type, which one cell cannot keep, so it is
-- `rigid_mismatch` at the annotation. `r : Ref (List String)` checks.
import Ref exposing (Ref)


pub cell : ⊤ → List String
cell ⊤ =
    r : Ref (List a)
    r = Ref.make []
    Ref.get r
